		"description": "<p>When you enter into a community which contains people whose heritage, culture, or background matches you or your companion, you may immediately make a Prestige check. On a success, outline an NPC by name and social role whose heritage, culture, or background matches either you or your companion. This connection is a friendly NPC of moderate social position in their chosen field who may be able to provide you with minor favors while you are within the settlement.</p>",
